.TH ZHEN\-AGENT 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 158367ea" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
zhen\-agent \- Run one Zhenai agent goal from the terminal through the Champion gate.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zhen\-agent
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run one Zhenai agent goal from the terminal through the Champion gate.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-k \fIN\fR
number of top\-K topics for seed retrieval (default 5)
.TP
.B \-\-max\-tokens \fIN\fR
llama\-server max_tokens per turn (default 600)
.TP
.B \-\-max\-topic\-chars \fIN\fR
per\-topic content cap (default 10000)
.TP
.B \-\-max\-turns \fIN\fR
agent loop budget (default 8)
.TP
.B \-\-project\-root \fISTRING\fR
Champion sandbox root (default: cwd)
.TP
.B \-q \fISTRING\fR
user goal (otherwise reads from stdin)
.TP
.B \-\-seed \fIN\fR
llama\-server seed (nonzero pins sampling)
.TP
.B \-\-show\-trace
print per\-turn trace to stderr
.TP
.B \-\-temperature \fINUM\fR
sampling temperature (default 0.4)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
zhen\-agent \-q 'list open kanban cards'
zhen\-agent \-q 'summarise the drift events' \-show\-trace
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
